text SSAnne_2F_Room3_Text_SeenMonsFerryPeople {
    "Ah, yes, I have seen some POKéMON\n"
    "ferry people across the water!$"
}

text SSAnne_2F_Room3_Text_SomeTreesCanBeCutDown {
    "Small trees can be chopped down\n"
    "using the move CUT.\p"
    "But remember this!\n"
    "CUT is an HM technique.\p"
    "Once learned, it is not so easily\n"
    "discarded.$"
}
